  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Negotiation Support for the Pacific Island Forum Secretariat (PIFS) Office, Geneva</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment partners with the United Kingdom&apos;s Trade and Investment Advocacy Fund. It provides technical assistance and negotiating support to developing countries to engage in the World Trade Organization (WTO), including negotiations on new disciplines. Australia&apos;s investment supports the PIFS Office in Geneva, which assists Pacific Island countries to engage actively in WTO negotiations and benefit from the multilateral rules-based trading system.</narrative>
  </description>
